"efdb7b4a29894d53549664d58da5bbf165ee6e1a": {"body":"The 15:55 message's replaces names the 12:33 one as\n\"...PT.261111123313.-PO-01-1939\" (its identifier: \"...123313.PO-01-1939\"),\nso the 12:33 wind to 18:00 stayed standing and the band still said\n\"Wind until 18:00\". idk() compares identifiers with punctuation other\nthan dots removed, in channels, changeLine and capRecord. On today's\ndata: ORANGE sea to 21:00, YELLOW rain to 18:00, wind row ORANGE\n12:00-15:56, note \"ended at 15:56\". 390 and 1280, light and dark: no\npage error, 0 under 11 px, no overflow.","session":"session_018yvwtQaQmHNoaLZWpcz47G","files":[{"p":"agents/weather/HANDOVER.md","a":1,"d":0},{"p":"app/weather/weather.js","a":9,"d":7}],"more_files":0},
"3aff58a8e8510728909b011a201624d7eff7016b": {"body":"channels(t): when IPMA's newest message for a hazard is newer than the\nopen-data feed, its windows already run are drawn (cDone) in place of the\nopen data's, also when neither channel has anything left to run. Before,\nthe 15:55 message (orange wind 12:00-15:56) left the wind row empty, and\nat 18:05 it showed the open data's 12:34-18:00. Tested with the message\nwritten into the built cap.json only; the band never says orange wind\nafter 15:56. Unchanged on today's real data; 390 and 1280, light and dark.","session":"session_018yvwtQaQmHNoaLZWpcz47G","files":[{"p":"agents/weather/HANDOVER.md","a":1,"d":0},{"p":"app/weather/weather.js","a":6,"d":2}],"more_files":0},
"02a9db205eeec4dc0509f10934ab16c92a520b62": {"body":"As of 16:10 UTC: IPMA's CAP sent 15:55:03 (timeline s-1111T1609): Lisbon's, Setubal's and\nBeja's orange wind ended early at 15:56; Faro's red rain to yellow and red wind to orange,\nto 18:00. Lisbon now: yellow rain to 18:00, orange sea to 21:00. The storm in observed\nfigures (26.2 mm hour, 74 km/h gust); CP's own notice (fact). Residents bars drawn from\n15:00 (E.bars_from): IPMA's file restarts re-issued warnings at their new onset, so earlier\nhours there read as zero. Editions 1-8 unchanged.","session":"session_018yvwtPVWJtSb1BoAg7xMvW","files":[{"p":"brief/README.md","a":6,"d":5},{"p":"brief/brief.css","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"brief/edition-9.json","a":441,"d":0},{"p":"brief/edition-9.md","a":23,"d":0},{"p":"tools/brief-make.mjs","a":3,"d":3}],"more_files":0},
